---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Eyebrow from '../components/Eyebrow.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Tiffany Webb" description="Meet Tiffany Webb. Discover her journey from Chicago to frontline behavioral health prevention." theme="secondary">
  <main class="page-content">
    
    <!-- 2.1 Hero -->
    <section class="inner-hero theme-dark">
      <div class="container reveal-up">
        <Eyebrow>About</Eyebrow>
        <h1 class="inner-hero-title">Meet Tiffany Webb</h1>
        <p class="inner-hero-sub text-micro">Community Impact Strategist &middot; Public Health Educator &amp; Speaker</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2.2 Her Roots -->
    <section class="roots section-pad">
      <div class="container stagger-group">
        <h2 class="stagger-item">Chicago soul, Louisiana heart.</h2>
        
        <div class="prose-column stagger-item">
          <p>Chicago-born and raised, with deep Louisiana family roots, Tiffany grew up between two places that shaped how she works. A city that taught her resilience and directness. A family culture that taught her hospitality — that you meet people where they are, and you feed them before you ask them anything.</p>
          
          <p>Hers was a family that believed in literacy, healing, and empowerment. Books on the table. Doors open. Somebody always being helped through something. That inheritance is what she brought into public health, and it is still how she works: start where the person actually is, not where the pamphlet assumes they are.</p>
          
          <p>She has spent more than fifteen years and over four thousand hours doing gambling-prevention outreach. Not from a conference room — in schools, clinics, community centres, and the rooms most prevention programs never reach. She came to it through behavioral health, and she stayed because she kept meeting families who had no language for what was happening to them.</p>
          
          <p>Gambling harm hides. It doesn't smell like alcohol or show up on a drug test. It shows up as a missing paycheck, a second job nobody understands, a marriage that quietly stops working. By the time most families name it, they have been carrying it alone for years.</p>
          
          <p>That is the silence her work exists to break. Her approach blends behavioral-health expertise, community outreach, and an entrepreneurial streak that turned a personal mission into a brand people wear. Every part of it points the same direction: turning pain into power for the people other programs overlook.</p>
          
          <blockquote class="pull-quote">"When we rise, we rise together."</blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2.3 Professional Journey -->
    <section class="journey section-pad bg-cream">
      <div class="container stagger-group">
        <h2 class="stagger-item">The path here.</h2>
        <p class="stagger-item subtitle">Behavioral health taught her how harm works. Community outreach taught her how trust works. Public health education taught her how to scale a message. Prevention is where all three meet.</p>
        
        <div class="timeline stagger-item">
          <div class="timeline-stages">
            <span class="timeline-step">Behavioral Health</span>
            <span class="timeline-arrow">&rarr;</span>
            <span class="timeline-step">Community Outreach</span>
            <span class="timeline-arrow">&rarr;</span>
            <span class="timeline-step">Gambling Prevention</span>
            <span class="timeline-arrow">&rarr;</span>
            <span class="timeline-step">Public Health Education</span>
            <span class="timeline-arrow">&rarr;</span>
            <span class="timeline-step">Coalition & Partnership Building</span>
            <span class="timeline-arrow">&rarr;</span>
            <span class="timeline-step">Speaking & Training</span>
            <span class="timeline-arrow">&rarr;</span>
            <span class="timeline-step">Community Impact Strategist</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2.4 Mission & 2.5 Vision & 2.6 Values -->
    <section class="core section-pad">
      <div class="container grid-2 stagger-group">
        <div class="mission-vision stagger-item">
          <Eyebrow>Mission</Eyebrow>
          <p class="mission-statement">So that no individual, family, or community faces gambling harm in silence, shame, or isolation — because prevention begins with a conversation.</p>
          
          <div class="vision mt-12">
            <h2>Where this is going.</h2>
            <ul class="vision-list">
              <li><strong>National speaking:</strong> Bringing prevention conversations to stages, campuses, and conferences across the country.</li>
              <li><strong>Training & education:</strong> Equipping clinicians, educators, and frontline teams with tools that survive contact with real life.</li>
              <li><strong>Community & GambleFreeGear:</strong> Building something people can join, wear, and carry into their own conversations.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="values stagger-item">
          <h2>What she works from.</h2>
          <ul class="values-list">
            <li><strong>Faith</strong> — the belief that people can change, including the ones everyone else gave up on.</li>
            <li><strong>Family</strong> — where prevention starts, and where harm is felt first and longest.</li>
            <li><strong>Community</strong> — nobody recovers alone, and nobody prevents alone either.</li>
            <li><strong>Purpose</strong> — turning lived understanding into practical service.</li>
            <li><strong>Impact</strong> — measured in conversations started, not talks delivered.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    
    <!-- GambleFreeGear Mention -->
    <section class="gfg-section section-pad bg-emerald color-ivory" id="gamblefreegear">
      <div class="container stagger-group text-center">
        <Eyebrow className="color-ivory">A Venture by Tiffany Webb</Eyebrow>
        <h2 class="stagger-item">GambleFreeGear</h2>
        <p class="subtitle stagger-item mx-auto mt-4" style="max-width: 600px;">
          Prevention you can wear. Tiffany Webb is the founder of GambleFreeGear, an apparel brand designed to break the silence on gambling addiction and start conversations in the communities that need them most.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 stagger-item">
          <a href="https://inpowerimports.com" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary" style="border-color: var(--color-ivory); color: var(--color-ivory);">Visit GambleFreeGear &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2.7 Closing -->
    <section class="closing section-pad text-center">
      <div class="container stagger-group">
        <h2 class="stagger-item">Let's start a conversation.</h2>
        <p class="subtitle stagger-item mx-auto" style="max-width: 600px;">Whether you're planning a conference, building a prevention program, or trying to reach a community that hasn't responded to anything yet — that's the work.</p>
        <div class="mt-8 stagger-item">
          <a href="/book" class="btn btn-primary">Invite Tiffany to Speak &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-content {
    padding-top: 0; /* Offset for nav */
  }

  .inner-hero {
    background-color: var(--color-ink);
    color: var(--color-ivory);
    padding: calc(var(--sp-24) + 80px) 0 var(--sp-12);
  }

  .container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--sp-6);
  }

  .inner-hero-title {
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-4);
  }

  .inner-hero-sub {
    color: var(--color-gold);
  }

  .section-pad {
    padding: var(--sp-24) 0;
  }

  .bg-cream {
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
  }
  
  .bg-emerald {
    background-color: var(--color-emerald);
  }
  
  .color-ivory, .color-ivory .eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-ivory) !important;
  }

  .prose-column {
    max-width: 720px;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
  }

  .prose-column p {
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-6);
  }

  .pull-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-emerald);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-gold);
    padding-left: var(--sp-6);
    margin: var(--sp-12) 0;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-8);
    max-width: 800px;
  }
  
  .gfg-section .subtitle {
    color: rgba(253, 252, 248, 0.85);
  }
  .gfg-section p {
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-4);
  }

  .timeline {
    padding: var(--sp-8);
    background-color: var(--color-ivory);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .timeline-stages {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--sp-4);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .timeline-arrow {
    color: var(--color-gold);
  }

  .grid-2 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-12);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .grid-2 {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: var(--sp-16);
    }
  }

  .mission-statement {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--color-emerald);
  }

  .mt-12 {
    margin-top: var(--sp-12);
  }
  
  .mt-8 {
    margin-top: var(--sp-8);
  }
  
  .mb-4 {
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-4);
  }

  .mx-auto {
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .text-center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .vision-list, .values-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sp-6);
    margin-top: var(--sp-6);
  }

  .vision-list li, .values-list li {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }
  
  .placeholder-box {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border: 1px dashed rgba(253, 252, 248, 0.5);
    color: rgba(253, 252, 248, 0.7);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
</style>
